All matters are In Person unless specially approved by the court at least 2 days prior to the hearing
. Please visit the
Public Court Hearings on Zoom page
for Zoom log on credentials and procedures, including requirements for noticing a Zoom hearing and Zoom etiquette.
Standing Zoom Credentials
: Download the
Zoom app
on your chosen device or launch the Zoom app and click “Join”.
